### For High or Medium impact, submit with event `REQUEST_CHANGES`

```markdown
**Security Review** — PR #{number}

**Impact:** {High|Medium}

**Required Changes:**
1. {required change mapped to finding}

**Findings:**
- **[{SEVERITY}] {Domain}: {Title}** — {one-line concern}. Reference: {EAP ID or framework}. Fix: {one-line remediation}.

{Repeat for each finding.}

**Remediation Prompts**

**{Finding Title}**
\`\`\`text
You are helping fix a security issue in mygainwell/eap-ref-architecture.

File: {path}
Issue: {one-sentence issue}
Constraint: {EAP guidance ID and section if applicable}

Refactor the relevant code to eliminate this risk while preserving existing behavior. Do not change unrelated logic. Show only the changed code with surrounding context to apply the diff.
\`\`\`

{Repeat for each CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM finding.}

{If applicable:}
**Out of Scope:** {items needing broader context}.
```
